> fp(x: real, y: real) = (x + 3 * y) ^ 4
> gp(x: real, y: real) = x ^ 4 + 12 * x ^ 3 * y + 54 * x ^ 2 * y ^ 2 + 108 * x * y ^ 3 + 81 * y ^ 4 + 1
> equiv fp gp
fp and gp differ at 1002001 points, e.g. x=-10, y=-10: 2.56e+06 vs 2.56e+06
> expand (x + 3 * y) ^ 4 - (x ^ 4 + 12 * x ^ 3 * y + 54 * x ^ 2 * y ^ 2 + 108 * x * y ^ 3 + 81 * y ^ 4 + 1)
  ucas: expand (x + 3 * y) ^ 4 - (x ^ 4 + 12 * x ^ 3 * y + 54 * x ^ 2 * y ^ 2 + 108 * x * y ^ 3 + 81 * y ^ 4 + 1)
expand (x + 3y)^4 - (x^4 + 12x^3*y + 54x^2*y^2 + 108x*y^3 + 81y^4 + 1)
  = -1
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
